  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/N1s2APm.png\" alt=\"Banner\" width=\"1903\" height=\"507\" /></p><center>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><h1 style=\"font-size: 24px;\">為你的 Minecraft 體驗增添更多樂器！</h1></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">受夠了只能靠山羊角笛作為音樂表達的方式嗎？或者你已經玩膩了原神樂器？</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">現在就來看看「更多樂器」模組吧！</span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #ff0000; --darkreader-inline-color: #ff1a1a;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\"><strong>! 此模組需要 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/genshin-instruments/\">原神樂器</a> v4.0 或更高版本 ！</strong></span></p></center>\n<!--<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Join the Development Livestream!</strong></h1>\n<p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YOqkeE_30Ik?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p><hr/>-->\n<p><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tDIAfkaUNag\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<p><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rnMmBKchqfI\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<br/>\n<p><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1CVVqa2BHVE\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<br/>\n<p><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NhZKh6O5eGQ\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<hr /><center>\n<p><h3><strong>你是內容創作者嗎？還是樂器演奏者？</strong></h3></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">請透過 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/private-messages/send?recipient=stavwasplays\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CurseForge 私人訊息</a> 聯繫我，將你的影片在此<strong>展示</strong>出來！</span></p>\n</center><hr /><br/>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n  <h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>⚠️ 重要 ⚠️：模組作者已結束本專案維護</strong></h2>\n<p>觀看下方影片以了解更多詳情：</p>\n<p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TUzdklT4vcs?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>  \n<h3>本模組為遊戲增添了以下樂器：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>長號</li>\n<li>小提琴（長音與短音切換 - 按右 Alt 鍵！）</li>\n<li>鋼琴（附帶琴架！）</li>\n<li>吉他</li>\n<li>薩克斯風</li>\n<li>多種亞洲／日本樂器：\n<ul>\n<li>箏</li>\n<li>三味線與撥片</li>\n<li>琵琶（常規與震音模式）</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>所有 16 種音符盒皆可作為可演奏的樂器！</li>\n</ul>\n<br/>\n<p><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bCLnB21RSj4\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>循環錄音器</h2>\n<p>使用循環錄音器為你的音樂疊加循環軌道！加入背景音樂讓你的演奏更加豐富，完全不需要第二個人來幫你記住曲目！</p>\n<h2>唱片</h2>\n<p>錄製曲目並與朋友們分享！使用<strong> <em>/emirecord</em></strong> 指令來匯出並燒錄唱片，享受合作的樂趣 ✨</p>\n<p>你可以在世界資料夾下的<em>generated</em> 目錄中找到你匯出的唱片。</p>\n<h2>完整 MIDI 支援！</h2>\n<p>作為原神樂器模組的一部分，所有樂器都具備原生 MIDI 支援 - 如同其父模組中的對應樂器一樣！</p>\n<p><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WaCIP4lWEzk\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<p><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MhHqXmaiCZA\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<p><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7PKk7qorFTk\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>現成唱片</h2>\n<p>在你的 Minecraft 世界中四處散落著隨機唱片 - 這是某個未知實體留下的痕跡... 0-0</p>\n<h3>所有唱片及其位置：</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Super Idol - De Xian Rong</strong>：叢林神廟</li>\n<li><strong>Sad Romance - Ji Pyeongkeyon</strong>：草原村莊</li>\n<li><strong>Timmy Trumpet &amp; Savage - Freaks</strong>：堡壘遺跡</li>\n<li><strong>有趣的唱片</strong>：廢棄礦井</li>\n<li><strong>H&auml;nschen klein - Franz Wiedemann</strong>：埋藏的寶藏</li>\n</ol>\n\n<br/>\n<details>\n<summary>「有趣的唱片」？裡面有什麼？</summary>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ?si=ltxfCMLOt79VN4BM\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</details>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>多人遊戲支援！</h2>\n<p>本模組與伺服器完全相容，並針對伺服器運行進行了最佳化。</p>\n<p>*因此，循環錄音器最多支援 255 個音符 - 可透過 evenmoreinstruments_looperMaxNotes 遊戲規則進行修改。</p>",
